dvbipitools (2.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium
  * dipitvhead: fixed encryption gap on key rotation (CA 0x4A75 test finding)
  * remux: fixed (dis-)continuity
  * x86_64 pclmulqdq and ARMv8 PMULL CRC32 calculations
  * CSA2 optimized: dvbcsa_encrypt to dvbcsa_bs_encrypt (flush on PCR keeps jitter in check)
  * merged dipidescramble CAS test tool - e2e tested
  * merged dipicam378 CAS test tool - e2e tested on vu+
 -- dvbipitools authors <unspecified@example.com>  Tue, 04 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0200

